<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/portal-nav') %>
<h1>Background Check</h1>
<p class="lead">The last step is a one-time background check through Checkr, our background check provider.</p>

<% if (!state) { %>
  <p class="message">We couldn't match your ZIP code (<%= r.zip5 || 'not entered' %>) to a U.S. state. Please <a href="/portal/personal">check your home ZIP code</a>, or contact <a href="mailto:<%= program.supportEmail %>"><%= program.supportEmail %></a>.</p>
<% } else { %>
  <dl class="summary">
    <div><dt>Your state</dt><dd><%= stateName %> <span class="muted-inline">(from ZIP code <%= r.zip5 %>, <a href="/portal/personal">update</a>)</span></dd></div>
  </dl>

  <div class="notice-strong">
    <p><strong>Use these exact details in Checkr</strong> so we can match your results to your application:</p>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>Legal name: <strong><%= [r.legal_first_name, r.middle_name, r.legal_last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' ') %></strong></li>
      <li>Email: <strong><%= r.email %></strong></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <% if (link) { %>
    <p>Checkr will ask you to review the required disclosures, authorize the background check and enter your details. It takes about 10 minutes. Results usually take 1–3 days.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="/portal/background-check/go" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start Background Check with Checkr</a>
    </div>
    <% if (sc && sc.link_opened_at) { %>
      <p class="muted">You opened the Checkr link on <%= fmtTime(sc.link_opened_at) %>. If you've finished, there's nothing else to do: we'll email you once your results are reviewed.</p>
    <% } %>
  <% } else { %>
    <p class="message">The background check for <%= stateName %> isn't available yet. We'll email you as soon as it is.</p>
  <% } %>
<% } %>
<p class="muted">Checkr handles your authorization and personal details directly. CSBFP never asks for your Social Security number.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/portal/dashboard">Back to Dashboard</a></div>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
